#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-upgrade-nix.md:28
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-upgrade-nix.md:30
msgid "This command upgrades Nix to the stable version."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-upgrade-nix.md:32
msgid ""
"By default, the latest stable version is defined by Nixpkgs, in [nix-"
"fallback-paths.nix](https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/raw/master/nixos/"
"modules/installer/tools/nix-fallback-paths.nix) and updated manually. It may "
"not always be the latest tagged release."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-upgrade-nix.md:36
msgid ""
"By default, it locates the directory containing the `nix` binary in the "
"`$PATH` environment variable. If that directory is a Nix profile, it will "
"upgrade the `nix` package in that profile to the latest stable binary "
"release."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-upgrade-nix.md:41
msgid ""
"You cannot use this command to upgrade Nix in the system profile of a NixOS "
"system (that is, if `nix` is found in `/run/current-system`)."
msgstr ""

